    <p>EXC is provided free of charge, on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We do not warrant that it will meet your requirements, that it will be uninterrupted, timely, secure or error-free, that the results obtained from it will be accurate or reliable, or that any errors will be corrected. Your use of EXC is at your own risk.</p>
